"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"No complete award itinerary surfaced in these search results, so I can’t recommend a bookable award journey yet. For the next check, I’d start with the January 9 United economy award lead: it reports 9 seats and 55,000 United miles, but the tradeoff is that it gives only a date—not a schedule or actual routing.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A26@2027-01-09/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 9 United economy award lead\",\"v\":\"The result reports 55,000 United miles and award taxes of USD 16.20; the quote scope is unknown, so that amount is not established as per traveler or a party total. It reports 9 seats. The schedule is date-only, and the actual flights, connections, and leg-by-leg cabins are not provided.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 1 Alaska economy award lead\",\"v\":\"This is another date-only lead for 42,500 Alaska miles, with 8 seats reported and award taxes of USD 50.90. The fee quote scope is unknown. Its different program and points amount are not directly comparable in value to the United or Aeroplan amounts; the actual schedule, routing, and leg-by-leg cabins are also missing.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A1@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 1 Aeroplan economy award lead\",\"v\":\"This lead reports 65,000 Aeroplan points, 2 seats, and award taxes of CAD 116.50. The fee quote scope is unknown. It has no schedule beyond the date, and the actual routing and leg-by-leg cabins are not provided.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C2@2027-01-01T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"January 1 cash itinerary baseline\",\"v\":\"The cash result shows EVA Air from SFO via TPE to BKK, departing at 12:00 p.m. on January 1 and arriving at 11:10 a.m. local time on January 3; it reports one stop and 32 hours 10 minutes elapsed. The displayed fare is USD 686.00, and the result reports one returned traveler, but the fare’s price scope is unknown. Treat it as a separate cash reference, not a confirmed per-traveler or all-in total.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The three award leads report economy, but none supplies leg-by-leg cabin details or a complete schedule, so none establishes the flights or connection pattern. The broader search recorded no selectable complete journeys and 378 selectable leads; coverage was partial, with some detail queries omitted and other queries only partly completed. These leads are not confirmation of current availability or prices. Verify the full itinerary, award space, cabin by leg, and final fees with the relevant booking program; confirm the cash fare with the seller.\"}]}"
